}, "id": "2089487985271480", "locale": "en_US", "screenshots": [{"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1836967047488729", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823949_1836967054155395_1120897136800744312_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FahRwgvmYbsQ7kNvwFkDg0g&_nc_oc=AdoePF3AB4sVfAhb31aFu-emBkY3lLTOWEV20pXmmOxMuh1f1S3FEhlQUd3qGzc8t3M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWDZViaRYV5lZ-6OdbU3QB9n-umQtHXwIKXEP8Ohd0gfA&oe=6B0EFB89"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1275618838019500", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1275618841352833_8554008071153350966_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=au1jh9MXh-4Q7kNvwHWGkJ4&_nc_oc=Adow2exGjSBjwUx7Rcysu-euidlez8TXvsc0J9l8N198JHPclZxCCD_zTbYoAd3Tewc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVtX2GHmHk_WD64DTPoiGdMwqdUJvLkv2CV0hYCqm2Dxg&oe=6B0F18F8"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "1117965891185082", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828050_1117965894518415_6814151965641248241_n.png?_nc_cat=104&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=go1i1zrOinYQ7kNvwEd06ka&_nc_oc=Adonwk_MRHnd7SHSj0rVWSJZey5ls_7bOZEsfp6eajsYJ9QppcKA2VP64UzSwlsye_Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUUfKp7eHp1EFnFE0Ajqaolthv8uhC_NW4spq8MACUdJA&oe=6B0EF305"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1741472703610770", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823905_1741472706944103_8801195682923137750_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=R_wKgj60cHgQ7kNvwHamyqz&_nc_oc=AdovQOZqDz0v1Ei3sy5aFyIPN9KyuqP8octEgZo622Xe0GEvxmadn8IuvFwlOGSlujs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQV32S9M0VF7kYpwj2absbrE6SxIrk8BaRS8kS9iGlV4Tw&oe=6B0F05B9"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1093583603388897", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_1093583606722230_3761521266589325580_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q-fb0GEugjUQ7kNvwH8UuuP&_nc_oc=AdpZ0CYuaIbvC31KHJH4X-372GBM3SISqjHRsqE7ZvGTxVlfTLoPYPhB6FQAqDCpW6s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVBzjbrgMl_zpa3IBMJt63ju2PPJhFB5vRv9OHAyhboIw&oe=6B0F0217"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440.png", "id": "1459128399676246", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824322_1459128406342912_6552788977963876814_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IfsPCoLQpRoQ7kNvwHsilyN&_nc_oc=AdpRuK9kVTNbp6K-jKgeBy36LiAvbrVt7cbso7P6HTCDrRrx1STZTTcd0xn0EPXktSs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW0l3mQA7jWacPXgePag9T7EWviAl6yBaEbtXvw0aMaWg&oe=6B0F0738"}, "display_name": "Orbitorium", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Orbitorium is a cozy space puzzle about gravity, played with your hands.\n\nA small universe floats in front of you: a launch pad, a glowing portal, and space in between. Pinch a planet from your console and place it anywhere in the box. Press **LAUNCH**: the rocket burns straight up, then coasts, and every planet you placed pulls on it. Get the pulls right and its path bends all the way into the portal. Get them wrong and it sails off into the dark, or into a rock. The dashed trail of your last flight stays behind, so every attempt teaches you something.\n\n### Features\n- **50 handcrafted levels** across five universes: First Light, Moonwake, Amber Reach, Velvet Deep and Last Horizon\n- **New ideas as you go:** drifting asteroids you have to time, wormholes, keys that unlock the portal, and levels with two rockets flying at once\n- **A star hidden in every level** for players who want 100%\n- **Mixed reality:** the universe floats in your own room\n- **Virtual reality:** play on a brass observatory deck drifting under the Milky Way\n- **Built for hand tracking;** Touch controllers work too\n- **Grab the universe** to turn it, move it or resize it, and look at your puzzle from any side\n- **Relaxed, stationary play** with no timers: take as long as you like\n\nNo rush, just curiosity and a feel for orbits.\n", "short_description": "Bend gravity to fly a rocket home. Orbitorium puts a small universe in front of you: pinch planets from your console, place them anywhere in space and launch. Their gravity curves the rocket's flight past asteroids, through wormholes and into the portal. 50 handcrafted puzzles across five universes, played with your hands in your own room or on an observatory deck floating among the stars.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://oniroidstudios.com/orbitoriumprivacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Oniroid Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://oniroidstudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "4025589647744704"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1648359516891380"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1648359516891380"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1791243300, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1648359516891380"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4032266817076987", "version": "0.1.0"}, "id": "1374529771104634", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4025589641078038", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "4032266817076987"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1374529771104634"}]}, "change_log": "Orbitorium 0.1.0 - first alpha\r\n\r\nBend the rocket's path with gravity and fly it into the portal.\r\n\r\n50 levels across 5 universes: First Light, Moonwake, Amber Reach, Velvet Deep and Last Horizon\r\nPlace planets with your hands (controllers work too), then launch\r\nDrifting asteroids, wormholes, keys and two-rocket levels\r\nA star to collect in every level\r\nPlay in your room in mixed reality, or on an observatory deck floating in space in virtual reality\r\nThanks for testing! Tell us which levels felt too hard or too easy.", "created_date": 1791232491, "id": "4032266817076987", "version": "0.1.0", "version_code": 1, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}